# Wave W17-P (Route 119): gauge turf — rain-soaked deep green under the permanent rain: the deepest green in Maris, saturated dark, with mushroom-pale flecks standing in it where the mushrooms keep everything else (design: calm speckled grass in a rain gorge, the Weather Institute’s ledgers against the river’s west bank). Route 119’s own ground — darker and wetter than Route 118’s river-damp ford turf by a full register: this grass never dries, and split from Yamato’s rain turf by the gorge depth and the mushroom flecks.
